# Private keys. The Apple Sign-in signing key (.p8) is a plain-text PEM file,
# so it is easy to save into the repo folder while wiring auth up and commit it
# without noticing. Anyone holding it can mint Apple sign-ins for this app.
*.p8
*.pem
AuthKey*.txt
store-screenshots/
